<title>UK: B.A.T gives more details on US tobacco deal.</title>
<headline>B.A.T gives more details on US tobacco deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>B.A.T Industries Plc on Monday disclosed further details about the likely impact of a landmark U.S. tobacco settlement on its Brown &amp; Williamson Tobacco Corp unit.</p>
<p>The company said it expected Brown &amp; Williamson to make an initial payment of about $1.7 billion out of the $10 billion that tobacco companies would pay under the deal when the proposal passes U.S. Congress.</p>
</text>
